{{sc|Priestess|It all happened so fast. The damage to the defense array exceeded ninety percent, and with all the extreme environmental damage we received, the repair units were finding it difficult to restore everything in the short time that we had.<br/>Not long after you began your hibernation, many of our colleagues left, one after the other. Everyone wanted to treasure the time they had before the stars fell. I understand how they felt.<br/>Now it's just the two of us left. Of course, [[Kal'tsit|AMa-10]] is still here as well. She's in good spirits, and still rather lively.<br/>But don't worry, what's left of Rhodes Island can still maintain its basic functions. We still have some time.<br/>When you are here with me, {nickname}, I'm not afraid of the end.<br/>No matter if our bodies collapse, or if our consciousnesses freeze, or if the laws of the universe invert, I can accept it all with open arms.<br/>I need only have you by my side.}}
