{{sc|Doctor|Kal'tsit... What are they?}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|This is no illusion or dream. It is all real, in a sense.<br/>All the people, all the things you have encountered in the past exist within your imagination. They took their forms based on what you most hoped to see.}}
{{sc|Doctor|They sully our memories. / How can you stay so calm?}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|These scenes affect me as much as they do you, Doctor.<br/>But they are ultimately the product of your thoughts.<br/>Originium, guided by your wishes deep in your subconscious and your desires to make up for past regrets, has reproduced what you wish to see.<br/>You continue to hold a deep regard for everything you have experienced alongside Rhodes Island, yet despite that, you were able to break away from this beautiful lie.<br/>Only now can I believe that you, as you are now, are still the Doctor of Rhodes Island.}}
{{sc|Doctor|Originium? Since when could it do this? / Why is it being guided by what I want?}}
{{sc|fades to white|mode=background}}
{{sc|All that you wish for, I am able to grant.|mode=subtitle}}
{{sc|5|mode=background}}
{{sc|Doctor|Pries...tess...}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|As I thought, you already...<br/>I once told you, Doctor, that others cannot tell you how to solve the mysteries surrounding you. You can only rely on yourself.<br/>I suspect that we are now extremely close to that critical juncture.}}
{{sc|mode=branchstart}}
{{sc|Doctor|If this is all based on my hopes, then are you...}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|I thought that our prior interactions would be sufficient for you to render an accurate judgement.}}
{{sc|mode=branch}}
{{sc|Doctor|I can at least say for sure that you are no illusion.}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|I hope that this judgement of yours is based on rationality, and not something else.}}
{{sc|mode=branchend}}
{{sc|Doctor|If these scenes are all about making up for regrets...<br/>Will I be able to meet Theresa?}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|I do not know for certain where Theresa is, nor what she is doing.<br/>What I am sure of is that she has something to do with this environment.}}
{{sc|Gentle Voice|Doctor.}}
{{sc|Doctor|—!<br/>Amiya!}}
{{sc|Amiya|Doctor, Dr. Kal'tsit. Good, you're both here.}}
{{sc|mode=branchstart}}
{{sc|Doctor|(Hesitate)}}
{{sc|Amiya|Don't worry, Doctor. I am the real Amiya. Really.}}
{{sc|mode=branch}}
{{sc|Doctor|(Step forward without hesitation)}}
{{sc|Amiya|*sniff* I was looking all over for you, Doctor.}}
{{sc|mode=branchend}}
{{sc|Doctor|You look a little different. / Your clothes...?}}
{{sc|Amiya|Theresa left me this dress.}}
{{sc|Doctor|So she really is here?}}
{{sc|Amiya|I haven't seen her. I've sensed no presence of her aboard this "Rhodes Island", in fact.}}
{{sc|Doctor|Did you run into any danger?}}
{{sc|Amiya|I'm fine.<br/>So many memories flowed before me...<br/>But not only memories. Emotions too, rich ones in every shape and form.<br/>I think that the people that we saw were truly alive.<br/>But this form of "life" just makes me... sad.<br/>After walking down this corridor and seeing you, I think I understand now.<br/>The emotions that I felt all stemmed from the same source, Doctor.}}
{{sc|Doctor|...Me.}}
{{sc|Amiya|Yes.<br/>I... "touched" you, Doctor. I've never done that before...}}
{{sc|The girl holds your hand, just as she has always done, but a little tighter, and more carefully this time.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Amiya|I know that you've changed a lot compared to the past, Doctor.<br/>But considering all that we've experienced together, I am even more convinced that... the you who stands before me now has always been the you that I've trusted the most.<br/>Memory may tell falsehoods, but emotion always speaks the truth.<br/>There are many things that I still don't understand at this moment. I have questions that can't be answered until we see Theresa once more.<br/>No matter what happens, no matter how many unhappy endings await us...<br/>You'll stand by my side, won't you, Doctor?}}
{{sc|Doctor|I will.<br/>I am Dr. {nickname} of Rhodes Island.}}
{{sc|Amiya|Good. That's all I ask for.<br/>Let's go find Theresa, then.}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|First, we must figure out how to leave.<br/>The answers we seek are not here.}}
{{sc|6|mode=background}}
{{sc|Logos|Though this is no illusion, heaven and earth, life and death...<br/>It is all falsehood.}}
{{sc|W|Hah, so even if you leave that dreary gallery of fakes, you'd just find yourself wandering around an even bigger stage?<br/>Who the hell set up these curtains for us? Their taste sucks.}}
{{sc|Footsteps approach.|mode=action}}
{{sc|W|Oh, looks like the main cast is finally here.<br/>Hey, crone, let's put that all-knowing brain of yours to good use. I've got a real big question I want answered—<br/>Where. The hell. Are we?}}
{{sc|fades out|mode=background}}
{{sc|Ocean of Solaris|mode=image}}
{{sc|A small boat, drifting atop an endless golden sea.|mode=speech}}
{{sc|Kal'tsit|We are within Originium.<br/>Within Originium, [[Assimilated Universe|there exists a universe]].}}
